  data: {
    LLM: "Priority: Capture the 10 of Diamonds (Big Kasino) and the 2 of Spades. Always try to leave the board with sums that DON'T equal 15 or 16.\n\nThe 'Spade Flush': Since most Spades are worth 2 points (the second highest scoring category), focus on capturing small Spades early to secure the lead.\n\nMÃ¶kki Defense: If there are only a few cards on the table, play a card that makes the total sum impossible for your opponent to capture (e.g., if there is a 7, don't play a 3 if your opponent might have a 5 to make a 15-capture).",
